      "name": "Theme control",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "theme-toggle",
      "description": "Banner button; destination label and sun/moon switching are supplied by site JavaScript.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-toggle\" aria-label=\"Switch to light theme\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M12 2v2m0 16v2M2 12h2m16 0h2M5 5l1.4 1.4m11.2 11.2L19 19M5 19l1.4-1.4M17.6 6.4 19 5\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-toggle{display:grid;place-items:center;width:38px;height:38px;border:0;border-radius:7px;background:#19181ae8;color:#fff;cursor:pointer}.ds-toggle svg{width:21px;height:21px}.ds-toggle:hover{background:#302b2a}.ds-toggle:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#e6ab89);outline-offset:5px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Social navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "social-navigation",
      "description": "Icon link from the identity social row.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-social\"><a href=\"mailto:hgpt185@gmail.com\" aria-label=\"Email\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"m3 6 9 7 9-7\"/></svg></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-social{display:flex;gap:24px;color:var(--body,#d1d5db)}.ds-social a{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:24px;height:28px;color:inherit}.ds-social svg{width:24px;height:24px}.ds-social a:hover{color:var(--accent,#e6ab89)}.ds-social a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#e6ab89);outline-offset:5px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Experience entry",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "job-row",
      "description": "Company, role, period, and supporting description on the page surface.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-job\"><div class=\"ds-job-heading\"><div><h3>Salesforce</h3><p class=\"ds-role\">Software Engineer II</p></div><p class=\"ds-period\">July 2024 - Present</p></div><p class=\"ds-description\">Building backend systems for Tableau Licensing Services.</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-job{padding-bottom:30px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule,#374151);font-family:var(--body-font,Inter,sans-serif);color:var(--body,#d1d5db)}.ds-job-heading{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}.ds-job h3{margin:0;font:600 24px/1.4 var(--title-font,Poppins,sans-serif);color:var(--foreground,#fafafa)}.ds-role{font-size:14px;margin:3px 0 0}.ds-period{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#9ca3af);white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin:0}.ds-description{font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;margin:14px 0 0}@media(max-width:480px){.ds-job-heading{display:block}.ds-period{margin-top:8px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project image",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "project-image",
      "description": "Illustrative 16:9 repository image; no raised card surface.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-project-image\" href=\"https://github.com/hgpt185/google-docs-clone\" aria-label=\"View Real-Time Collaborative Editor on GitHub\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?w=800&amp;h=450&amp;fit=crop&amp;auto=format\" alt=\"Illustrative photograph for Real-Time Collaborative Editor\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></a>",
      "css": ".ds-project-image{display:block;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:12px;background:var(--image-background,#242328)}.ds-project-image img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform 500ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-project-image:hover img{transform:scale(1.035)}.ds-project-image:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#e6ab89);outline-offset:5px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-project-image img{transition:none}}"
